WEBVTT

00:04:58.461 --> 00:05:02.423
Let me repeat that
in case you didn't get that.

00:05:03.007 --> 00:05:06.927
Eighty percent of all
the world's biodiversity

00:05:06.969 --> 00:05:09.388
is within Indigenous territories.

00:05:10.222 --> 00:05:12.350
The Amazon, where I come from,

00:05:12.391 --> 00:05:15.895
is home to more plant and animal species

00:05:15.895 --> 00:05:19.899
than any other terrestrial
ecosystem on this planet,

00:05:19.899 --> 00:05:25.154
including 40,000 plant species,

00:05:25.154 --> 00:05:27.281
2,200 fish,

00:05:27.323 --> 00:05:30.618
427 mammals.